# Manual test requests for the Leave API.
#
# 1. Sign in through IdentityService (http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login)
#    as a student, then paste the returned accessToken below.
# 2. Send the requests with the "Send Request" link above each one
#    (VS Code REST Client / Visual Studio HTTP editor).

@LeaveService_HostAddress = http://localhost:8082
@studentToken = paste-student-access-token-here
@wardenToken = paste-warden-access-token-here

### Submit a leave request (student)
POST {{LeaveService_HostAddress}}/api/student/leave-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departureDate": "2026-12-20",
  "expectedReturnDate": "2026-12-27",
  "reason": "Family wedding",
  "companionName": "Nimal Perera",
  "companionRelationship": "Father",
  "companionPhone": "0771234567"
}

### List my leave requests (student)
GET {{LeaveService_HostAddress}}/api/student/leave-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### View one of my leave requests (student)
GET {{LeaveService_HostAddress}}/api/student/leave-requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Unread leave notifications (warden or hostel master)
GET {{LeaveService_HostAddress}}/api/staff/leave-notifications?unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}

### Mark a notification as read (warden or hostel master)
PUT {{LeaveService_HostAddress}}/api/staff/leave-notifications/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{wardenToken}}
